      "modified": "2026-10-09 10:27:23",
      "modified_utc": "2026-10-09 14:27:23",
      "url": "https://knoxhartford.org/event/knox-harvest-market-2026/",
      "rest_url": "https://knoxhartford.org/wp-json/tribe/events/v1/events/22488",
      "title": "KNOX Harvest Market",
      "description": "<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6a5a391 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6a5a391\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<h4><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-22490 size-medium\" src=\"https://knoxhartford.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Screenshot-2026-10-08-125402-300x197.png\" alt=\"Past Harvest Market\" width=\"300\" height=\"197\" srcset=\"https://knoxhartford.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Screenshot-2026-10-08-125402-300x197.png 300w, https://knoxhartford.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Screenshot-2026-10-08-125402.png 700w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" />The air is crisp and the foliage is bright and beautiful &#8211; which means it&#8217;s time to announce that <strong>the KNOX Harvest Market is on Saturday, November 21st!</strong></h4>\n</div>\n<p>From 10 am to 2 pm, KNOX&#8217;s greenhouse will be bustling with local merchants, all ready to help you fulfill your needs for a cozy fall and holiday season.</p>\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p>Our 17th annual market will feature tasty food, music, and all sorts of vendors. This end of season celebration serves as a way for our farmers to sell their product alongside other small businesses and local artists. Join us again this year for our KNOX Harvest Market!</p>\n</div>\n<p>Interested in becoming a vendor? We&#8217;re looking for food and beverage vendors, as well as local artists and makers! <a href=\"https://wl.donorperfect.net/weblink/WebLink.aspx?name=E351653&amp;id=138\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click here to fill out the vendor form.</a></p>\n</div>",
